# Environment variables
# Copy this file to `.env` for local development:
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# Current application
# -------------------
# No environment variables are required to run the existing local demo.
# The site content, admin demo session, and enquiries are currently stored in browser localStorage.
#
# Future Supabase integration (not implemented yet)
# -------------------------------------------------
# These names are reserved for the planned Supabase phase. Do not add real values to git.
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
# VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=your-publishable-key
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=server-only-secret-do-not-expose-to-client
